# =====================================================================================
# PROVISIONAL – for Rohit's review, not flight-approved. SIMULATION ONLY.
# Downward rangefinder (Gazebo gpu_lidar 1 beam, /airmouse/rangefinder) forwarded by
# ArduPilotPlugin as JSON rng_1 and read by the SITL rangefinder driver (type 100).
# =====================================================================================
RNGFND1_TYPE     100
RNGFND1_ORIENT   25
RNGFND1_MIN_CM   20
RNGFND1_MAX_CM   800
# Sensor is 0.035 m below the body origin, i.e. ~0.5 cm above the ground at rest.
RNGFND1_GNDCLEAR 1
